{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>MINISO x Chiikawa鬆弛藍調系列</h2>\n<p>Chiikawa再度攜手MINISO，推出全新「鬆弛藍系列」，讓Chiikawa、小八與烏薩奇換上清爽的牛仔藍、淺藍與灰色造型，三隻人氣角色彷彿走進冬日街頭，把可愛萌感與街頭潮流感完美融合。\n</p>\n<h2>必買公仔/冷帽/衛衣/帆布袋</h2>\n<p>系列一口氣帶來多款高顏值又實用的周邊，包括連帽上衣、大容量帆布袋、棒球帽、角色吊飾及迷你公仔。當中必買冷帽，柔軟毛球搭配角色造型，既保暖又上鏡，勢必成為冬季穿搭的亮點單品。此外，換上藍色系服裝的角色公仔同樣值得入手！系列將於11月20日起率先在中國指定大型門市首發；11月23日起，則開放全通路販售。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122555031914_12757163736afc7a1a07ede.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122555031914_12757163736afc7a1a07ede.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122728787499_4779104976afc7a1bcc7e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122728787499_4779104976afc7a1bcc7e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122969542454_17137205206afc7a1e10687.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493122969542454_17137205206afc7a1e10687.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df2FrM0k17_/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.520466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":380,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:32:27.155732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:32.572233+00:00","content_hash":"a64b56cbfe4fec4dfb8d39f0b0eaa0e6a92ec298f548b724fdf3f87b63b34635","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}